WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.342
What is The Master's Edge?

2
00:00:02.542 --> 00:00:04.707
It's the method behind everything

3
00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:06.499
I teach, built over more than

4
00:00:06.499 --> 00:00:10.680
thirty years in business and more
than forty years in martial arts.

5
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.574
It has three steps.

6
00:00:12.774 --> 00:00:16.432
Clarify: strip away assumptions
and see the real problem.

7
00:00:16.432 --> 00:00:18.150
Simplify: be prepared, not

8
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.256
surprised, with the tools you need
before the challenge arrives.

9
00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:24.495
Maximize: build the conditions for

10
00:00:24.495 --> 00:00:27.332
flow, so peak performance isn't
left to luck.

11
00:00:27.532 --> 00:00:29.451
Clarify what matters.

12
00:00:29.851 --> 00:00:31.993
Simplify how you operate.

13
00:00:32.393 --> 00:00:34.386
Maximize your results.
